FT to roll with advantage, CTRL to roll with disadvantage.\" data-roll-name=\"Charisma save\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;d20&quot;,&quot;context&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;savingThrow&quot;,&quot;ability&quot;:&quot;cha&quot;},&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Charisma save&quot;,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;-3&quot;,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;1d20-3&quot;,&quot;d20mod&quot;:&quot;-3&quot;}\" data-roll-prof-type=\"d20\" data-roll-prof-dice=\"+1d0 - 3\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\">-3</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Vulnerabilities</span> Thunder</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Immunities</span> Poison; <a href=\"https://5e.tools/conditionsdiseases.html#exhaustion_phb\" data-vet-page=\"conditionsdiseases.html\" data-vet-source=\"PHB\" data-vet-hash=\"exhaustion_phb\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\"true\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(125, 182, 232); text-decoration: none;\">Exhaustion</a>, <a href=\"https://5e.tools/conditionsdiseases.html#paralyzed_phb\" data-vet-page=\"conditionsdiseases.html\" data-vet-source=\"PHB\" data-vet-hash=\"paralyzed_phb\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\"true\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(125, 182, 232); text-decoration: none;\">Paralyzed</a>, <a href=\"https://5e.tools/conditionsdiseases.html#petrified_phb\" data-vet-page=\"conditionsdiseases.html\" data-vet-source=\"PHB\" data-vet-hash=\"petrified_phb\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\"true\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(125, 182, 232); text-decoration: none;\">Petrified</a>, <a href=\"https://5e.tools/conditionsdiseases.html#poisoned_phb\" data-vet-page=\"conditionsdiseases.html\" data-vet-source=\"PHB\" data-vet-hash=\"poisoned_phb\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\"true\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(125, 182, 232); text-decoration: none;\">Poisoned</a>, <a href=\"https://5e.tools/conditionsdiseases.html#unconscious_phb\" data-vet-page=\"conditionsdiseases.html\" data-vet-source=\"PHB\" data-vet-hash=\"unconscious_phb\" data-vet-is-allow-redirect=\"true\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(125, 182, 232); text-decoration: none;\">Unconscious</a></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Senses</span> <span class=\"ve-help ve-help--hover\" data-vet-page=\"sense\" data-vet-source=\"XPHB\" data-vet-hash=\"darkvision_xphb\" data-vet-is-faux-page=\"true\" style=\"cursor: help !important; text-decoration: underline dotted !important;\">Darkvision</span> 60 ft., <span class=\"ve-help ve-help--hover\" data-vet-page=\"sense\" data-vet-source=\"XPHB\" data-vet-hash=\"tremorsense_xphb\" data-vet-is-faux-page=\"true\" style=\"cursor: help !important; text-decoration: underline dotted !important;\">Tremorsense</span> 60 ft., Passive Perception 10</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Languages</span> Primordial (Terran)</td></tr><tr class=\"ve-relative\" style=\"position: relative !important;\"><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px;\"><span title=\"Challenge Rating\" style=\"font-weight: 700;\">CR</span> 5 (XP 1,800; <span title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">PB</span> +3)&nbsp;</td></tr><tr></tr><tr></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px;\"><h3 class=\"ve-stats__sect-header-inner\" style=\"font-family: Convergence, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 100; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(210, 154, 56); margin-top: 3px; margin-bottom: -1px; font-size: 17px; font-variant: small-caps; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(210, 154, 56);\">Traits</h3></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-stats__sect-row-inner\" style=\"padding: 0.5rem 4px 1px;\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Earth Glide\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"19\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\">Earth Glide.</span> The elemental can burrow through nonmagical, unworked earth and stone. While doing so, the elemental doesn't disturb the material it moves through.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Siege Monster\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"20\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\">Siege Monster.</span> The elemental deals double damage to objects and structures.</p></div></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" style=\"padding: 1px 4px;\"><h3 class=\"ve-stats__sect-header-inner\" style=\"font-family: Convergence, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 100; line-height: 18px; color: rgb(210, 154, 56); margin-top: 3px; margin-bottom: -1px; font-size: 17px; font-variant: small-caps; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(210, 154, 56);\">Actions</h3></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"6\" class=\"ve-stats__sect-row-inner\" style=\"padding: 0.5rem 4px 1px;\"><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Multiattack\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"16\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\">Multiattack.</span> The elemental makes two attacks, using Slam or Rock Launch in any combination.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Slam\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\" style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"17\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\">Slam.</span> <i>Melee Attack Roll:</i> <span class=\"ve-roller render-roller\" title=\"Click to roll. SHIFT to roll with advantage, CTRL to roll with disadvantage.\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;+8&quot;,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;1d20+8&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;d20&quot;,&quot;d20mod&quot;:&quot;+8&quot;,&quot;context&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;hit&quot;}}\" data-roll-prof-type=\"d20\" data-roll-prof-dice=\"+1d6 + 5\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\">+8</span>, reach 10 ft. <i>Hit:</i> 14 (<span class=\"ve-roller render-roller\" title=\"Click to roll. SHIFT to roll a critical hit, CTRL to half damage (rounding down).\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;2d8 + 5&quot;,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;2d8 + 5&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;damage&quot;}\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\">2d8 + 5</span>) Bludgeoning damage.</p></div><div data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Rock Launch\" class=\"ve-rd__b  ve-rd__b--named ve-rd__b--3\"><p><span class=\"ve-rd__h ve-rd__h--3\" data-title-index=\"18\" style=\"line-height: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-style: italic; color: rgb(194, 194, 194);\">Rock Launch.</span> <i>Ranged Attack Roll:</i> <span class=\"ve-roller render-roller\" title=\"Click to roll. SHIFT to roll with advantage, CTRL to roll with disadvantage.\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;+8&quot;,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;1d20+8&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;d20&quot;,&quot;d20mod&quot;:&quot;+8&quot;,&quot;context&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;hit&quot;}}\" data-roll-prof-type=\"d20\" data-roll-prof-dice=\"+1d6 + 5\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\">+8</span>, range 60 ft. <i>Hit:</i> 8 (<span class=\"ve-roller render-roller\" title=\"Click to roll. SHIFT to roll a critical hit, CTRL to half damage (rounding down).\" data-packed-dice=\"{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;dice&quot;,&quot;rollable&quot;:true,&quot;toRoll&quot;:&quot;1d6 + 5&quot;,&quot;displayText&quot;:&quot;1d6 + 5&quot;,&quot;subType&quot;:&quot;damage&quot;}\" style=\"color: rgb(125, 182, 232); cursor: pointer;\">1d6 + 5</span>) Bludgeoning damage. If the target is a Large or smaller creature, it has the <a href=\"https://5e.tools/conditionsdiseases.html#prone_xphb\" data-vet-page=\"conditionsdiseases.html\" data-vet-source=\"XPHB\" data-vet-hash=\"prone_xphb\" style=\"background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); color: rgb(125, 182, 232); text-decoration: none;\">Prone</a> condition.</p></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>",
